1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:04,170
(Raj:)Why so glum, chum?

2
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:06,170
(Sheldon:)Apparently,
you can't hack into

3
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:08,140
(Sheldon:)a government
supercomputer

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,740
(Sheldon:)and then try
to buy uranium

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:11,870
(Sheldon:)without the Department of
Homeland Security tattling

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,040
(Sheldon:)to your mother.

7
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:19,920
(Priya:)Oh, that's too bad.

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,480
(Howard:)Figure out the magic trick yet?

9
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:23,790
(mocking):
Figure out the magic trick yet?

10
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:26,020
(Howard:)Want me to tell you
how to do it?

11
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:26,860
(Priya:)No.

12
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,590
Ill show you one more time.

13
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,190
(Howard:)Raj?

14
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:31,890
(Penny(knocking on window):)Hang on.

15
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,830
(Sheldon:)This time do it with me,

16
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:37,130
(Sheldon:)so I can make sure
there's no monkey business.

17
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:42,110
(Penny:)All right.

18
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:55,900
(Howard:)Two of hearts.
I hate you.

19
00:01:04,030 --> 00:01:06,460
(Howard:)Yeah, he's gonna win
the Nobel Prize.

